<title>USA: Weirton Steel Corp Q3 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Weirton Steel Corp Q3 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>WEIRTON, W.Va. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.18   profit	 $0.16</p>
<p> Net loss		   7,674   profit	 7,181</p>
<p> Sales		    366,174		  341,421</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  42,347		   43,746</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
