<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Nine months ended September 30, 1996, included a charge of $16.9 million, or $0.13 per share, related to restructuring charges and the early retirement of debt.</p>
<p>1995 results include a $41.5 million insurance recovery.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
